# SAP NW RFC SDK — drop files here before building the Docker image
#
# Download from SAP Support Portal:
#   https://support.sap.com/en/product/connectors/nwrfcsdk.html
#   → "SAP NW RFC SDK 7.50" → Linux on x86_64 64bit
#
# Unpack so that this directory contains:
#   lib/
#     libsapnwrfc.so
#     libsapucum.so
#     (other .so files)
#   include/
#     sapnwrfc.h
#     (other headers)
#
# This file (.gitkeep) is intentionally committed so the directory exists.
# The SDK files themselves are NOT committed (see .gitignore).
